From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:22:51 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] four-three

A 4:3 choice in the Picture row of the NES, SNES, Master System and
Mega Drive Screen sections. It draws the picture at a 4:3 display
aspect at full height (640x480 centred on the 720x480 panel) by
choosing a source rect 9/8 of the picture wide on the fixed canvas,
so the canvas margins become the pillars and no frame size changes.
SELECT+X on SNES and Mega Drive and L1 on NES and Master System
include it. Factory defaults are unchanged. Idea from
cloudwithax/unslot 4cf8468 (GPL-3.0),
https://github.com/cloudwithax/unslot/commit/4cf8468
